The reaction datasets are Buchwald--Hartwig C--N couplings from high-throughput plates. Following \citet{Ahneman2018}, they are grouped by additive, so each held-out fold holds four or five additives unseen in training. The two sets share 3,955 reactions (Appendix~\ref{app:datasets}).

