\begin{enumerate}[leftmargin=*]
    \item No weighting: the hybrid as selected.
    \item Feature weighting: standardized features multiplied by the square root of their importance, with the weights normalized to average 1.
    \item Molecule weighting: molecules weighted by how well their label agrees with their 10 nearest neighbors in the rescaled space.
