\paragraph{Trastuzumab--HER2 binding.} This is the library of trastuzumab variants in the ten-residue CDR-H3 (the third complementarity-determining region of the heavy chain), screened for HER2 binding by \citet{Chinery2024}. The released training, validation and test files are joined and re-split. All 524,346 variants have a 10-residue CDR-H3 and are kept; 32.8\% are binders. From these, 5,000 variants were drawn once, stratified so that each combination of label and number of mutated CDR-H3 residues keeps its share; the sample holds 1,639 binders (32.8\%). Each 120-residue heavy chain is rebuilt by inserting the variant CDR-H3 into the trastuzumab framework, and paired with the fixed trastuzumab light chain.

